+## invoices
+
+- `invoices.hold_invoice(invoice_id)`: put an open invoice on hold to pause collection; returns the invoice. Holding an invoice already on hold returns it unchanged. Raises `E_NOT_FOUND` for an unknown ID and `E_BAD_STATE` if the invoice is not open.
+
 ## rates
 
 - `rates.quote(weight_kg, zone)`: price for a weight and zone
